@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Actual saved-history live HTTP lifetime
+
+Parent: `7930e9009296f895e27a234a86b5d649041bd428`.
+
+The actual QA handler creates one private original-material holder after context cloning and attaches it to both async producer and HTTP sender. Producers reuse it. The model, handler completion and HTTP references release independently; only the final release closes actual original parent/source leases. The writer checks HTTP cancellation, original body/control/owner/current actor and independent SourceGuard before Write/Flush, including after URL rewriting.
+
+The actual completed UpdateMessage transaction appends an immutable `message_producer_advances` edge from its exact prior admission/revision/membership to the newly sealed material. Transfer changes only the excluded current assistant control from incomplete to completed. Every other candidate/proof, current owner, membership and actual scope remains exact. Slot and guard locks serialize commit/transfer against HTTP and heartbeat checks. No arbitrary replan or current-body admission is accepted. Fresh151/70 and a real forward helper create this metadata table; existing rows receive no edges.
+
+The raw actual user query control is protected by its original user receipt; source-bearing frames pass the existing mandatory SourceGuard before serialization and again at the writer. On refusal the sender closes with fixed terminal code text, without source holdback or successful completion.
+
+Verified scope: actual public KnowledgeQA with persisted historical original, local model, real final producer and real Write/Flush. Ordinary and signed source positives, body/control ABA, current actor/source revocation, cancellation, expiry, concurrent completion/heartbeat/HTTP and lease cleanup.
+
+Open scope: newly retrieved RAG search/hydration has separate physical read guards currently closed at return; root coordinates that integration. Running Continue consumes Redis frames without native original frame receipts and requires a separate native registry/receiver authority module. Completed Continue uses original saved reconstruction from the parent checkpoint. Rewind/steer/memory/artifact/import/export and cross-tenant Agent acceptance remain active work.
